<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Northwest Pipe rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Northwest Pipe rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Stephens Inc said it initiated coverage of Northwest Pipe Co with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $1.80 per share for 1996, $1.86 for 1997, and $2.13 for 1998, compared to $1.43 for 1995.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $24.</p>
<p>-- Shares closed off 1/4 to 15-1/2 on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
